ghostslice-report.html

# Monorepo: packages/ holds the 35 companion projects, each its own
# package with its own tests and release gate. The core scanner honours
# .gitignore, so core dogfood runs (ci checks, dead-code scan) scope to
# the core tree, exactly as they did in the standalone repo. The
# packages are tracked in git; this entry only scopes the scanner.
packages/
